{"id":"word:hebrew:H2506","type":"word","title":"חֵלֶק","subtitle":"H2506 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"properly, smoothness (of the tongue); also an allotment","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to חֵלֶק (H2506) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 67 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"חֵלֶק (chêleq) means properly, smoothness (of the tongue); also an allotment First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 12 16."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"חֵלֶק","transliteration":"chêleq","pronunciation":"khay'lek","strong":"H2506","lemmaId":"hebrew:H2506","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["חֵ֥לֶק","חֵ֨לֶק","חֶלְק֔/וֹ","חֵ֣לֶק","בְּ/חֵ֥לֶק"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",18],["HNcmsc",9],["HNcmsc/Sp1cs",6],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",6],["HR/Ncmsc",4],["HNcmpa",4],["HNcmsc/Sp3mp",4],["HR/Ncmsa",3],["HNcmsc/Sp2ms",3],["HC/Ncmsa",2]]},"definitions":{"short":"properly, smoothness (of the tongue); also an allotment","usage":"flattery, inheritance, part, × partake, portion.","full":"H2506. cheleq I. חֵ֫לֶק noun masculine Josh 18:5 portion, tract, territory — ׳ח absolute Gen 31:14 +; construct 14:24 +; suffix חֶלְקִי Psa 16:5-6 t.; חֶלְקְךָ Num 18:20 ; Eccl 9:9 ; חֶלְקֶ֑ךָ Psa 50:18 ; חֶלְקֵךְ Isa 57:6 ; חֶלְקוֺ Hab 1:16 5 t.; חֶלְקָם Gen 14:24 3 t.; plural חֲלָקִים Josh 18:5 5 t.; suffix חֶלְקֵיהֶם Hosea 5:7 ; &#8212; 1 portion, share: a. of booty Gen 14:24 (twice in verse); Num 31:36 (P) 1Sam 30:24 (twice in verse). b. of food Lev 6:10 (P); ׳ח ׳כּח יאכלו Deut 18:8 ; = food Hab 1:16 (|| מַאֲכָל ); so (of unrestricted charity) Eccl 11:2 see Now. c. followed by בְּ , share or interest in Eccl 9:6 , with idea of obligation to Gen 31:14 (E; in father's house), 2Sam 20:1 = 1Kin 12:16 2Chr 10:16 (in royal line; all || נַחֲלָה ); of right ( privilege ) in ׳ח ביהוה Josh 22:25 , 27 (P); Neh 2:20 (in Jerusalem; + וְזִכָּרוֺן צְדָקָה ), d. proper share or part חֶלְקִי אַעֲנֶה Job 32:17 i.e. I will do my part in replying. Especially 2 portion, tract , of land: a. as distributive at conquest Josh 19:9 , seven portions 18:5-6 , 9 (all J E) 18:7 (J E; + נחלה in || clause), 15:13 ; 19:9 (both P); none for tribe of Levi Deut 10:9 ; 12:12 ; 14:27 , 29 ; 18:1 ; Josh 18:7 (all D; || נחלה ), 14:4 (P), none for priests Num 18:20 (P; || verb נחל ). b. of land possessed by people Hosea 5:7 ; Micah 2:4 . c. portion to be assigned after exile Isa 61:7 ; Ezek 45:7 ; 48:8 , 21 , הַקֹּדֶשׁ עַלאַֿדְמַת חֶלְקוֺ Zechariah 2:16. d. specifically of town-land , district about a town, ׳ח יִזְרְעֵאל 2Kin 9:10 , 36 + 1Kin 21:23 ( חֵל ᵑ0 ), בְּח ׳הַשָּׂדֶה ׳יִזְ 1 Kings 21:37. e. הַחֵלֶק Amos 7:4 (opposed to תְּהוֺם ) apparently of land of Israel 3 hence portion , i.e. (acquired) possession: a. of people as ׳י s possession Deut 32:9 (|| נחלתו חֶבֶל ); but especially b. of ׳י as possession of his servants: of priests, as enjoying perquisites of altar Num 18:20 (P; || נחלה ), in spiritual sense Psa 73:26 ; 119:57 ; Lam 3:24 ; ׳י חֶלְקִי מְנָת Psa 16:5 ; ׳ח הַחַיִּים בְּאֶרֶץ 142:6 ; hence ׳ח יעקב of ׳י Jer 10:16 = 51:19 ( נַחֲלָתוֺ שֵׁבֶט in || clause) 4 chosen portion , habitual mode of life ח ׳עִםמְֿנָאֲפִים Psa 50:18 with adulterers is thy chosen life (companionship, shewing character); חֶלְקֵךְ בְּחַלְּקֵינַֿחַל Isa 57:6 among smooth (things i.e. stones) of a brook-bed is thy chosen life (of idolatrous habit; see חָלָק ); בַּחַיִּים חֶלְקָם Psa 17:14 . 5 portion, award , from God ׳ח אֱלוֺהַּ Job 31:2 (|| נחלה ); specifically of punishment of wicked Isa 17:14 (|| גּוֺרָל ), עִםאֵֿל Job 27:13 , מֵאֱלֹהִים 20:29 (|| נחלה ); = profit, reward מִכָּלעֲֿמָלִי חֶלְקִי Eccl 2:10 , compare 2:21 ; 3:22 ; 5:17 ; 5:18 ; 9:9 . &#8212; לְחֵלָק Job 17:5 is dubious: a share of feast, or of booty, Kmp Hi; a prey, spoil , Ew Di Da; AV flattery does not suit context. III. חֵ֫לֶק noun [masculine] smoothness, seductiveness of speech, only singular construct תַּדִּיחֶ֑נּוּ שְׁפָתֶיהָ בְּחֵלֶק Prov 7:21 with the seductiveness of her lips she impelleth him (|| לִקְחָהּ בְּרֹב הִטַּתּוּ ). — I. and II. חֵלֶק see below I. חלק .","rootNote":"from 2505 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 12 16","keyReferences":["1Kgs 12 16","1Sam 30 24","1Sam 30 24","2Chr 10 16","2Kgs 9 10","2Kgs 9 36","2Kgs 9 37","2Sam 20 1"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":67,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 12 16","book":"1Kgs","chapter":12,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֵ֨לֶק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 30 24","book":"1Sam","chapter":30,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כְּ/חֵ֣לֶק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 30 24","book":"1Sam","chapter":30,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּֽ/כְ/חֵ֛לֶק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"2Chr 10 16","book":"2Chr","chapter":10,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֵ֨לֶק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"2Kgs 9 10","book":"2Kgs","chapter":9,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/חֵ֥לֶק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"2Kgs 9 36","book":"2Kgs","chapter":9,"verse":36,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/חֵ֣לֶק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"2Kgs 9 37","book":"2Kgs","chapter":9,"verse":37,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/חֵ֣לֶק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"2Sam 20 1","book":"2Sam","chapter":20,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֵ֜לֶק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Amos 7 4","book":"Amos","chapter":7,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/חֵֽלֶק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 10 9","book":"Deut","chapter":10,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֵ֥לֶק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Deut 12 12","book":"Deut","chapter":12,"verse":12,"englishText":"","source